<h1 align=""center"">Empowering Minecraft Agents with Open-World Skills</h1>

<div align=""center"">
	<a href=""https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.15325""><img src=""https://img.shields.io/badge/arXiv-2407.15325-b31b1b.svg""/></a>
