## List of supported LLM providers

The Denodo AI SDK supports the following LLM providers:

* OpenAI
* AzureOpenAI
* Bedrock
* Google
* GoogleAIStudio
* Anthropic
* NVIDIA
* Groq
* Ollama
* Mistral
* SambaNova
* OpenRouter

Where Bedrock refers to AWS Bedrock, NVIDIA refers to NVIDIA NIM and Google refers to Google Vertex AI.

