<!--- BADGES: START --->

[![Arxiv](https://img.shields.io/badge/arXiv-2409.00608-B31B1B.svg)][#arxiv-paper-package]
[![GitHub license](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-blu.svg)][#license-gh-package]

