rag_chatbot.py,backend/services/rag_chatbot.py,3540836fba829113f02df2ec620fc67a3061c7a0,gitprajapati/syngenta_hackathon_2025,https://api.github.com/repositories/992184864/contents/backend/services/rag_chatbot.py?ref=193b1f4d6a85dfc510bdde9c19c4bf4d6ab1b879,https://api.github.com/repositories/992184864/git/blobs/3540836fba829113f02df2ec620fc67a3061c7a0,https://github.com/gitprajapati/syngenta_hackathon_2025/blob/193b1f4d6a85dfc510bdde9c19c4bf4d6ab1b879/backend/services/rag_chatbot.py,,,0,0,1,4,2025-06-11T10:38:18Z,0,0,"# Syngenta Hackathon 2025

This repository contains a full stack project developed for the Syngenta Hackathon 2025. The backend exposes a FastAPI service with RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation) capabilities and the frontend is a Vue 3 application.

## Project Structure

- **backend/** – FastAPI service and machine learning utilities.
- **frontend/** – Vue 3 web client.

## Prerequisites

- Python 3.10+
- Node.js 16+

## Backend Setup

```bash
cd backend
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
# Optional: create a `.env` file to override settings in `core/config.py`
uvicorn main:app --reload
```

The service will start on `http://localhost:8000` with automatically generated Swagger docs available at `/docs`.

## Frontend Setup

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run serve
```

The default development server runs on `http://localhost:8080` and proxies API requests to the backend.

## License

This project is provided for hackathon use. See individual source files for license information.
