## Getting Started

1. Install with Docker (2 minutes)  
2. Add your LLM API keys (OpenAI, Claude, etc.)  
3. Create your first Workspace  
4. Add a Brain with files or data  
5. Start chatting with AI  
6. Invite your team and scale collaboration

