| Env Variable Name       | Mandatory/Optional | Default Value | Description                                                                                      |
|-------------------------|--------------------|---------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| OPENAI_API_KEY          | Mandatory          |               | API key for OpenAI                                                                               |
| DIFFBOT_API_KEY         | Mandatory          |               | API key for Diffbot                                                                              |
