### **Testing**

```bash
# Test API health
curl http://localhost:8000/health

# Test VideoDB search
curl ""http://localhost:8000/videodb/search?query=machine%20learning""

# Test video processing
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/upload-video \
  -F ""video=@videos/example.mp4""

# Test clip generation
curl -X POST ""http://localhost:8000/videodb/video/{video_id}/generate-clip"" \
  -H ""Content-Type: application/json"" \
  -d '{""topic"": ""product demo"", ""duration"": 30}'

# Test dubbing
curl -X POST ""http://localhost:8000/videodb/video/{clip_id}/dub"" \
  -H ""Content-Type: application/json"" \
  -d '{""target_language"": ""es""}'
```

