api.py,api/api.py,1fc5568331987b32bb612bf92cbadf57dc40952d,ramadantamer45/CV_ranking,https://api.github.com/repositories/984005061/contents/api/api.py?ref=6c1ac632dd32df4d14b9e967203ee9bd8a5ab6fe,https://api.github.com/repositories/984005061/git/blobs/1fc5568331987b32bb612bf92cbadf57dc40952d,https://github.com/ramadantamer45/CV_ranking/blob/6c1ac632dd32df4d14b9e967203ee9bd8a5ab6fe/api/api.py,,,0,0,0,2,2025-05-15T08:43:56Z,0,0,"# CV Ranking System

![CV Ranking System](https://img.shields.io/badge/AI--Powered-Resume%20Analysis-blue)
![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.8%2B-blue)
![FastAPI](https://img.shields.io/badge/FastAPI-modern%20backend-green)
![Streamlit](https://img.shields.io/badge/Streamlit-interactive%20UI-red)
![RAG](https://img.shields.io/badge/Architecture-RAG-yellow)

An AI-powered application that helps recruiters efficiently match job candidates to positions by analyzing and ranking CVs based on job requirements.

## 📋 Overview

The CV Ranking System uses a **Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)** architecture combining vector databases with Large Language Models (LLMs). It leverages natural language processing, vector embeddings, and similarity search to automatically analyze resumes, extract key information, and rank candidates against specific job requirements. The system provides an intuitive interface for recruiters to streamline the candidate selection process.

## ✨ Key Features

- **AI-Powered CV Analysis & Ranking**: Automatically analyzes CVs and ranks candidates based on similarity to job requirements AND LLM preference
- **Dual-Ranking Methodology**: Combines vector similarity scores with LLM-based qualitative analysis for more accurate candidate evaluation
- **Interactive AI Chat**: Ask questions about candidates to get insights and detailed analysis 
- **Candidate Comparison**: Side-by-side comparison of multiple candidates with detailed analysis
- **Job Post Management**: Create, edit, and manage job postings with customizable requirements
- **Application Portal**: Generate shareable links for candidates to submit applications directly
- **Contact Information Extraction**: Automatically extracts contact details from CVs
- **PDF Generation**: Export candidate rankings and comparisons as PDF reports

## 🛠️ Technology Stack

- **RAG Architecture**: 
  - **Vector Database**: [FAISS](https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss) for efficient similarity search and retrieval
  - **Large Language Model**: Azure OpenAI models for context-aware candidate assessment
- **Backend**: [FastAPI](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/) for high-performance API endpoints
- **Frontend**: [Streamlit](https://streamlit.io/) for interactive web interface
- **NLP**: 
  - [Sentence Transformers](https://www.sbert.net/) for embedding generation
  - [Spacy](https://spacy.io/) for text processing
- **AI Chat**: Integration with [Azure OpenAI](https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/products/ai-services/openai-service) for intelligent candidate analysis
- **Data Processing**: LangChain for document processing pipelines
- **Data Storage**: File-based storage for CVs, applications, and job descriptions

