✅ **Production Patterns**: Error handling, logging, documentation  
✅ **Clean Architecture**: Modular, testable, and maintainable code  
✅ **Real-time UI**: HTMX for dynamic interactions without complexity  

**Perfect for demonstrating AI engineering capabilities in job interviews!** 🚀

---

