- **Virtual Environment**: `datasplitter_env` (user preference)
- **Model Default**: `gpt-4.1-nano` (user preference)
- **Database**: ChromaDB persistent storage in `./chroma_db`
- **Dependencies**: All latest versions for production readiness

**Total Lines of Code**: ~800 (400 backend + 400 frontend)  
**Development Time**: Stage 1 completed in Day 1  
