## 🔌 **API Reference**

### 🟢 Health Check
```http
GET /health
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  ""status"": ""healthy"",
  ""timestamp"": ""2023-10-27T10:30:00.123456+00:00"",
  ""uptime"": 12345.67,
  ""version"": ""1.0.0""
}
```

### 💬 Chat Endpoint
```http
POST /chat
```

**Request:**
```json
{
  ""message"": ""What are the symptoms of diabetes?"",
  ""session_id"": ""user123-sessionabc"",
  ""user_id"": ""user123""
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  ""response"": ""Based on medical literature, diabetes symptoms include..."",
  ""sources"": [
    {
      ""content"": ""Medical Question: What is the first-line treatment..."",
      ""metadata"": {
        ""source"": ""MedQA"",
        ""category"": ""Endocrinology"",
        ""type"": ""QA_pair""
      },
      ""relevance_score"": 0.95
    }
  ],
  ""session_id"": ""user123-sessionabc"",
  ""retrieval_accuracy"": 0.85,
  ""response_time"": 1.5
}
```

### 📜 Conversation History
```http
GET /chat/history/{session_id}?limit=10
```

### 📊 System Metrics
```http
GET /system/metrics
```

