[![Python 3.11+](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.11+-blue.svg)](https://www.python.org/downloads/)
[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)
[![Code style: ruff](https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/astral-sh/ruff/main/assets/badge/v2.json)](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff)

A sophisticated multi-agent system for comprehensive research and planning using LangChain, LangGraph, and advanced AI orchestration. Generate professional research reports with automated source collection, analysis, and citation management.

## 🌟 Key Features

- **Multi-Agent Architecture**: LangGraph-based workflow orchestration with state management
- **Intelligent Research Planning**: Adaptive planning strategies (ReAct, Plan-and-Execute, Dynamic Replanning)
- **Comprehensive Source Collection**: Web search, arXiv papers, scholarly articles, financial data, news aggregation
- **Advanced Analysis**: Data extraction, trend identification, statistical analysis, visualization generation
- **Professional Reporting**: Template-based report generation with multiple citation styles (APA, IEEE, Chicago, MLA, Harvard)
- **Scenario-Based Research**: Pre-configured scenarios for renewable energy, AI education, healthcare wearables, sustainable fashion
- **RAG Integration**: ChromaDB vector store for enhanced context retrieval
- **Robust Error Handling**: Circuit breakers, retry mechanisms, comprehensive logging
- **Performance Monitoring**: Metrics collection, telemetry, system health checks

